    "title": "1941 AirAttack: Airplane Games",
    "description": "1941: Defend the Skies in the Early Years of World War II\r\nRelive the pivotal early years of World War II (1941-1945) Frozen Front, Pacific Front  in 1941, a thrilling modern combat flight simulator ! Take the helm as a squadron leader and fight for air force superiority against the growing Axis threat.\r\n\r\nIf you are already a fan of sky space chicken shooting games, strikers 1945 gun action games or alien shooter arcade games, fly shooting games or galaxy rescue shooting games, legendary fighter planes, then you cannot miss 1941 - The best strike Airplane Shooting offline Game (not online game) about the war period world 2 from 1941, 1942 , 1943, 1944 until the climax of 1945. 1941 is a gunship game that brings us back to the historical period in the most vivid way with top-notch, surreal, and immersive graphics and sound. giving players a very wonderful experience.\r\nYou can play games even when you don't have internet and play anywhere, even when you're on the train, racing, driving a car or helicopter... Whether you're a boy or a girl, a child or an adult, you can play. Play for free this best warfare classic game.\r\n\r\nYour journey begins on November 17th, 1941. Pilot the iconic warplanes Curtiss P-36 Hawk as you race to bolster the defenses at Pearl Harbor before the infamous attack of enemy on December 7th. But the fight doesn't end there.\r\n\r\nAssemble Your Arsenal:\r\n\r\nRecruit elite pilots military to bolster your squadron.\r\nCommand a diverse fleet of historical jet aircraft including:\r\nCaudron C.714\r\nHeinkel He 162\r\nBreda Ba.27\r\nHawker Hector\r\nPZL.50 Jastrz\u0105b\r\nAnd more!\r\nUpgrade your wings aircraft with a variety of enhancements to suit your playstyle.\r\n\r\n*******Experience the War's Intensity********\r\n\r\n5 Sprawling WWII Battle fields: Pilot your plane across a variety of theaters of war.\r\n150 Challenging Campaigns: Master demanding missions and earn valuable rewards.\r\n6 Historical Aircraft & Wingmen: Choose from a variety of planes, each with unique strengths and upgrade paths.\r\nComming soon Mode PVP (Next time feature)\r\nOptimized Performance: Smooth gameplay on both powerful and less powerful devices.\r\nThe skies are yours to claim! Choose your aircraft, become a master pilot, and rewrite historical in 1941! Let's download 1941 AirAttack: Airplane Games now!",
